&lt;p>At the third year of the junior high school, I received the guidance of &lt;a class="link" href="https://faculty.uestc.edu.cn/zhengyonghao/zh_CN/index.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
>Prof. Yonghao Zheng&lt;/a> and &lt;a class="link" href="https://sose.uestc.edu.cn/info/1032/6984.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
>Prof. Fucai Liu&lt;/a> at University of Electronic Science and Technology of China and did some research on semiconductor and chips.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>During the first two years of university, I learned embedded and get the first prize of Fujian province of TI Cup National Undergraduate Electronics Design Contest.&lt;/p>
